name: Add discovery membership to the real proposal's uncovered files without starting work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_addition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES | copied-model-boundaries
keys: Enter /
type: Add discovery scope
require-live-snap: 20 Add discovery scope | add-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ADD DISCOVERY SCOPE | new-boundary-name
keys: C-Home C-k
type: Greeting discovery
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 crates/greeting/Cargo.toml | complete-gap-prefill
keys: C-Home C-k
type: ../outside
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 Action stopped | invalid-membership
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_addition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME invalid
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 DRAFT SCOPES | cancelled-private-draft
keys: Enter /
type: Add discovery scope
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Add discovery scope | reopen-add-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ../outside | restored-private-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_addition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restored
ask: Does invalid membership retain the edited draft and cursor, with the saved proposal unchanged and no model request or scan?
keys: C-Home C-k
paste-file: @ART/greeting-members.txt
keys: Tab C-Home C-k
type: Inspect greeting implementation while retaining shared interface context.
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 ADD DISCOVERY SCOPE | add-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 ADD DISCOVERY SCOPE | add-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 ADD DISCOVERY SCOPE | add-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 ADD DISCOVERY SCOPE | add-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 ADD DISCOVERY SCOPE | add-40x12
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 r2 | saved-new-boundary-40x12
expect: Greeting discovery
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 20 Greeting discovery | covered-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_addition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME added
ask: Is the new discovery scope distinct from shared context, with zero uncovered files and acceptance still required?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | acceptance
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | separately-accepted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_addition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepare
keys: Escape
submit: campaign owned-added-scope-study
require-live-snap: 25 12 | fixed-unapproved-plan
ask: Does the prepared plan retain four explicit boundaries, three passes each and one worker, with job execution and spending approval still separate?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | recovered-boundaries
expect: Greeting discovery
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_addition.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color restart recover accepted membership while preserving the original live proposal, all source files, zero provider calls and zero started jobs?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
